description: Coach-pair increments, concise takeaways, no repetition
alwaysApply: true
---

# Learning work

For cohort assignments, follow [`docs/LEARNING.md`](../../docs/LEARNING.md).

- Propose one small increment: one objective, one observable behavior, expected
  files, one focused check. Wait for agreement.
- Shortest useful explanation first. More depth only if asked or a gap appears.
- If `.learning/index.md` exists, read it and skip already-covered explanations
  and links. Record only the learning delta.
- After a verified increment, write `.learning/YYYY-MM-DD-task-slug.md` from
  [`docs/templates/LEARNING_TAKEAWAY.md`](../../docs/templates/LEARNING_TAKEAWAY.md)
  and update `.learning/index.md`. Do not commit `.learning/`.
- Do not silently complete assessed work. Human review and `yarn validate:ci`
  remain authoritative.

Maintainer requests to implement, fix, or document use Ship mode.
